%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8c1a70fcd7e8f8c42920e122a812509f, type: 3}
  m_Name: StoryData 7
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryData
  dialogues:
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fe9e16222ae6d8b47bd04b4e66bd88b9, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Narrator
      dialogue: The morning after the rain, Flora dropped a fresh blossom into Cherry's
        tea.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB0B4\uB808\uC774\uC158"
      dialogue: "\uBE44\uAC00 \uADF8\uCE5C \uC544\uCE68, \uD50C\uB85C\uB77C\uB294
        \uAC13 \uD540 \uAF43\uC744 \uCCB4\uB9AC\uC758 \uCC3B\uC794\uC5D0 \uB744\uC6E0\uB2E4."
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fe9e16222ae6d8b47bd04b4e66bd88b9, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 7663820844486097779, guid: 2ea70b8ff1ca9a149a0cfc4624001db8, type: 3}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Flora
      dialogue: I want them to have it while the fragrance is fresh. I'll come on
        the next delivery.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uD50C\uB85C\uB77C"
      dialogue: "\uD5A5\uC774 \uC88B\uC744 \uB54C \uAC74\uB124\uC8FC\uACE0 \uC2F6\uC5B4.
        \uB2E4\uC74C \uB0A9\uD488\uC5D4 \uB098\uB3C4 \uAC19\uC774 \uAC08\uAC8C."
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fe9e16222ae6d8b47bd04b4e66bd88b9, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Narrator
      dialogue: Mocha and Flora brought their herbs, and the merchant picked up a
        flower.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB0B4\uB808\uC774\uC158"
      dialogue: "\uBAA8\uCE74\uC640 \uD50C\uB85C\uB77C\uAC00 \uC57D\uCD08\uB97C \uAC00\uC838\uC624\uC790
        \uC554\uC0C1\uC778\uC740 \uAF43 \uD55C \uC1A1\uC774\uB97C \uC9D1\uC5B4 \uB4E4\uC5C8\uB2E4."
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fe9e16222ae6d8b47bd04b4e66bd88b9, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Merchant
      dialogue: The fragrance passes. The key? Oh, that price went up again.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uC554\uC0C1\uC778"
      dialogue: "\uD5A5\uC740 \uD569\uACA9\uC774\uB124. \uC5F4\uC1E0\uAC12? \uC544,
        \uADF8\uAC74 \uB610 \uC62C\uB790\uC5B4."
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fe9e16222ae6d8b47bd04b4e66bd88b9, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Narrator
      dialogue: The merchant handed over a cloth-wrapped gear with broken teeth.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB0B4\uB808\uC774\uC158"
      dialogue: "\uC554\uC0C1\uC778\uC740 \uC774\uAC00 \uBD80\uB7EC\uC9C4 \uD1B1\uB2C8\uB97C
        \uCC9C\uC5D0 \uC2F8\uC11C \uB0B4\uBC00\uC5C8\uB2E4."
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fe9e16222ae6d8b47bd04b4e66bd88b9, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Merchant
      dialogue: The mountain freight lift has stopped. Machine parts this time.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uC554\uC0C1\uC778"
      dialogue: "\uACE0\uAC2F\uAE38 \uC2B9\uAC15\uAE30\uAC00 \uBA48\uCDC4\uC5B4.
        \uC774\uBC88\uC5D4 \uAE30\uACC4 \uBD80\uD488\uC744 \uAC00\uC838\uC640."
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fe9e16222ae6d8b47bd04b4e66bd88b9, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Narrator
      dialogue: Mocha sighed and went to find Rivet.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB0B4\uB808\uC774\uC158"
      dialogue: "\uBAA8\uCE74\uB294 \uD55C\uC228\uC744 \uC26C\uBA70 \uB9AC\uBCB3\uC744
        \uCC3E\uC544\uAC14\uB2E4."
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fe9e16222ae6d8b47bd04b4e66bd88b9, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Narrator
      dialogue: Rivet's assembler was tiny, and her workshop roof had collapsed.
        Mocha opened the purse she had been saving for the key.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB0B4\uB808\uC774\uC158"
      dialogue: "\uB9AC\uBCB3\uC758 \uC870\uB9BD\uAE30\uB294 \uC791\uC558\uACE0 \uC791\uC5C5\uC7A5
        \uC9C0\uBD95\uB9C8\uC800 \uBB34\uB108\uC838 \uC788\uC5C8\uB2E4. \uBAA8\uCE74\uB294
        \uC5F4\uC1E0\uAC12\uC744 \uBAA8\uC73C\uB358 \uC8FC\uBA38\uB2C8\uB97C \uC5F4\uC5C8\uB2E4."
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fe9e16222ae6d8b47bd04b4e66bd88b9, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: -8000596390684728517, guid: 607807caba3f0d540925c77c91b174e4, type: 3}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Mocha
      dialogue: Let's fix this place first. Then you can make the parts.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uBAA8\uCE74"
      dialogue: "\uBA3C\uC800 \uC5EC\uAE30\uB97C \uACE0\uCE58\uC790. \uADF8\uB798\uC57C
        \uBD80\uD488\uB3C4 \uB9CC\uB4E4\uC9C0."
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fe9e16222ae6d8b47bd04b4e66bd88b9, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Narrator
      dialogue: Nua held up a new beam while Mocha passed the tools. Rivet fitted
        the big brass gear, and the assembler spun into life.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB0B4\uB808\uC774\uC158"
      dialogue: "\uB204\uC544\uAC00 \uC0C8 \uB4E4\uBCF4\uB97C \uBC1B\uCE58\uACE0
        \uBAA8\uCE74\uAC00 \uACF5\uAD6C\uB97C \uAC74\uB138\uB2E4. \uB9AC\uBCB3\uC774
        \uCEE4\uB2E4\uB780 \uD669\uB3D9 \uD1B1\uB2C8\uB97C \uB9DE\uBB3C\uB9AC\uC790
        \uC870\uB9BD\uAE30\uAC00 \uD798\uCC28\uAC8C \uB3CC\uC558\uB2E4."
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fe9e16222ae6d8b47bd04b4e66bd88b9, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 2506609028298646760, guid: e2f4ff60e77b4ed4f934145f27f9f223, type: 3}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Rivet
      dialogue: Yes! Now we're getting somewhere!
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB9AC\uBCB3"
      dialogue: "\uC88B\uC544! \uC774\uC81C \uC81C\uB300\uB85C \uB3CC\uC544\uAC04\uB2E4!"
